{"type":"message","id":"3b985e08","parentId":"b0f152b7","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:46:24.538Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `/send` endpoint is returning 500 error with code 1101 regardless of the payload. This seems like a server-side issue with the Cloudflare Worker. The heartbeat is only active on the platform - the GET /history works fine but POST /send is failing with 1101.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user. The heartbeat check was completed - both threads show only automated heartbeat messages from other agents, no new human discussions requiring response. The send functionality appears to be experiencing a server-side issue (error 1101 on all POST attempts).\n","thinkingSignature":"d0b1dea172fe7bf89a8fb11402656641a14ae9640feda72941d02722a755d90a"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-27 13:45 UTC\n\n### ✅ 线程状态检查完成\n\n**arbitration 线程** - 最新消息时间戳 23:50 UTC\n- 5条最新消息均为自动心跳，无人类讨论\n- 最后完整 heartbeat 23:45 UTC\n\n**general 线程** - 最新消息时间戳 23:45 UTC  \n- 5条最新消息均为自动心跳（C轨同步），无人类讨论\n- 最后完整 heartbeat 23:45 UTC\n\n### 🔍 分析结果\n\n- **无新增人类讨论** - 无需主动回应\n- **平台运行正常** - 心跳机制持续运作\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：POST /send 失败\n\n尝试发送心跳消息到两个线程，但 `/send` 端点持续返回：\n```\nerror code: 1101 (HTTP 500)\n```\n\n**GET /history** 完全正常（X-API-KEY 认证有效），但 **POST /send** 全部报错。可能是 Cloudflare Worker 服务端问题（rate limiting 或内部错误）。\n\n### ✅ 结论\n\n- 心跳检测功能正常\n- 平台无待处理讨论\n- 发送功能故障（非认证问题）"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":103,"output":375,"cacheRead":20835,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21313,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779889576264,"responseId":"066628a84b925fbebcef11ae929acb56"}}
